ind":"announcement","title":"New fishing spots and a reworked reel — What's new #5","summary":"Hi, Max here! A new demo update for Rogoz Fishing is out. This time it's about exploring the river: new fishing spots with fast travel, a separate reel, livelier fights and a handful of fixes. Here's what's changed: The river New fishing spots on the river — open the map and click a spot to travel there quickly. The deep pits have moved to the far bank, so big catfish no longer show up right next to camp during the tutorial. Tackle The rod and reel are now separate parts of your tackle, and the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T21:15:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040692","verified_at":"2026-10-24T23:25:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832370-1847286114026970","game_id":"steam-4832370","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo keeps getting better: new fish species & Mastery levels — What's new #4","summary":"Hi, Max here! I'm continuing to improve the Rogoz Fishing demo. This update brings new fish species, Mastery levels, a refreshed interface and a little more comfort by the river. Here's what's changed: Fish and trophies Six new fish species! Sturgeon are temporarily unavailable to catch while their model is being replaced. Progress and comfort Added Mastery: catching fish earns experience, and new levels unlock tackle and rewards. Reworked the interface: the shop, equipment, journal and in-game ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114026970","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:11:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832370-1846651706682613","game_id":"steam-4832370","kind":"announcement","title":"The Rogoz Fishing demo is out! What's new #3","summary":"Hi! The day has finally come: the Rogoz Fishing demo is out and available on Steam right now. Over the last few weeks I've heavily reworked the fish fight and finished everything I could get my hands on. Here's what changed: Fighting fishThe fish fight has been completely reworked: it is now a real battle against your tackle, where the drag and rod work decide everything.You can feel a big fish in your hands: the camera and the reel convey its weight.Fish rest, lunge and panic near the bank, so ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:53:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682613","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832370-1846018067924728","game_id":"steam-4832370","kind":"announcement","title":"Road to Next Fest: What's New in Rogoz Fishing #2","summary":"Hi, Max here again! Less than two weeks to go until Steam Next Fest, and the Rogoz Fishing demo has grown a lot in that time. I listened to the playtest feedback and tried to make fishing even more alive and cozy. Here's what's changed: Fighting FishHooked fish fight in a livelier, less predictable way.You can now hear the line tension.Fish rise from the depths gradually, and their splashes look and sound real.RiverFish now have their own habitats: where you cast really matters.New depth map whe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T01:40:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924728","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832370-1844751498226211","game_id":"steam-4832370","kind":"announcement","title":"Road to Next Fest: what's new in Rogoz Fishing #1","summary":"Hi, it's Max, the solo developer behind Rogoz Fishing. Very soon I'll be happy to show you the demo, and after that the full game! Rogoz Fishing is a cozy bottom-fishing game where I'm putting everything I love about fishing: the thrill, the excitement, the waiting, the nerves and the calm. They seem like feelings that can't go together, yet fishing somehow brings them all into one. The free demo will be playable during Steam Next Fest starting October 19, and lately I've been busy getting it re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T00:09:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4832370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4832370":"2026-10-26T04:44:23Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4832370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5140830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:44:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4832370","app_id":4832370,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:00Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b066c0a34415f502e14ab17cb121bdac30d856bd52bdecb97f9be4993c7b77f5","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A meditative fishing sim with deeply detailed fish behavior and habitats. Pick your spot on the depth map, set several rods with different baits, read the bites by the 